  m_text: "To escape this room, you will solve a word search puzzle. To cross out
    a word on the crossword, click and drag the purple lines to cover the words.
    Each line is set for the length and angle of a different word. \n\nWord List:
    Click on a word to cross it out.\n\n After you find all of the words on the list,
    the code is revealed in the leftover letters. Start reading the leftover letters
    in the top left corner and continue to the right like a book."
